# The long game past the first tools (mechanics pass 2c; Guide.within_reach):
# with a pick in the bag and ore off the rock, the making page's "within reach"
# row names the next elite material the player lacks, how it is had, and where:
# the coast's own first, the machine that walks here. The goal line never says
# it: nobody pointed him at it, so up there it read as a recipe out of nowhere.
# With no lead given the goal line is empty (frame 01).
#   tools/tour.sh tours/late_goal.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=pick:1,iron_ore:1
coast calm
place spawn
wait 3.0
shot 01-no-lead-no-goal-line
tap craft
await app:crafting 8
shot 02-the-making-page-names-an-elite-material-and-where with app:crafting
tap craft
await app:none 6
